    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Sacred Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur is a squirrel who lives doing what he loves most: eating watermelons. But one day, an evil witch steals the Sacred Tree of his favorite fruit and casts a curse that forces him to jump constantly. Now, unable to stop, Arthur must embark on a dangerous adventure across 5 different worlds to recover the stolen tree and restore his life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Platforming with Pixel Art Style and Modern Lighting</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Controls with a Twist</strong>: Constant jumping! Master your jump timing and turn the curse to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to combine dodging and gliding to overcome all obstacles on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: A custom score perfectly crafted for the adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 unique worlds</strong>\u00a0Filled with beautiful landscapes and distinct mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 levels</strong>\u00a0Packed with obstacles and enemies to conquer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+60 collectibles and timed challenges</strong>\u00a0to push your skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+20 unique costumes</strong>\u00a0to dress Arthur!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Sacred Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur is a squirrel who lives doing what he loves most: eating watermelons. But one day, an evil witch steals the Sacred Tree of his favorite fruit and casts a curse that forces him to jump constantly. Now, unable to stop, Arthur must embark on a dangerous adventure across 5 different worlds to recover the stolen tree and restore his life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Platforming with Pixel Art Style and Modern Lighting</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Controls with a Twist</strong>: Constant jumping! Master your jump timing and turn the curse to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to combine dodging and gliding to overcome all obstacles on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: A custom score perfectly crafted for the adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 unique worlds</strong>\u00a0Filled with beautiful landscapes and distinct mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 levels</strong>\u00a0Packed with obstacles and enemies to conquer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+60 collectibles and timed challenges</strong>\u00a0to push your skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+20 unique costumes</strong>\u00a0to dress Arthur!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Arthur Loves Watermelon is a unique 2D platformer in which you don\u2019t control when you jump. In it, you\u2019ll help a small squirrel named Arthur recover the Sacred Watermelon Tree from the hands of an evil witch.",
